    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585690/extras/d77d51e55617ce8d23a010c58d9a82bd.avif?t=1743174818\" width=569 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585690/extras/bbf0ff371f83bc8f26b8f59c3a8e2bba.poster.avif?t=1743174818\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585690/extras/bbf0ff371f83bc8f26b8f59c3a8e2bba.webm?t=1743174818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585690/extras/bbf0ff371f83bc8f26b8f59c3a8e2bba.mp4?t=1743174818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crown of Lust is a fantasy adult visual novel that throws you into the diplomatic deep end as Prince Aldric, a sheltered royal sent to as an envoy of peace into the fearsome Kingdom of Valoria\u2014a land your kingdom has been at war with for generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raised on terrifying tales of Valorian savagery, you arrive at their borders expecting the worst...only to discover that the &quot;barbarians&quot; are a kingdom of beautiful women who find your royal mannerisms equally as strange as you find their  customs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585690/extras/21eefdbcd618f6999564b89ef315a44d.avif?t=1743174818\" width=569 height=92 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings based on decisions and choices made throughout the game</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple romanceable love-interests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated spicy scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the lands of Lumeria</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translations for multiple languages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585690/extras/baddb8f72857e34ace592abac9fbe2ad.avif?t=1743174818\" width=568 height=278 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585690/extras/d77d51e55617ce8d23a010c58d9a82bd.avif?t=1743174818\" width=569 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585690/extras/bbf0ff371f83bc8f26b8f59c3a8e2bba.poster.avif?t=1743174818\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585690/extras/bbf0ff371f83bc8f26b8f59c3a8e2bba.webm?t=1743174818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585690/extras/bbf0ff371f83bc8f26b8f59c3a8e2bba.mp4?t=1743174818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crown of Lust is a fantasy adult visual novel that throws you into the diplomatic deep end as Prince Aldric, a sheltered royal sent to as an envoy of peace into the fearsome Kingdom of Valoria\u2014a land your kingdom has been at war with for generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raised on terrifying tales of Valorian savagery, you arrive at their borders expecting the worst...only to discover that the &quot;barbarians&quot; are a kingdom of beautiful women who find your royal mannerisms equally as strange as you find their  customs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585690/extras/21eefdbcd618f6999564b89ef315a44d.avif?t=1743174818\" width=569 height=92 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings based on decisions and choices made throughout the game</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple romanceable love-interests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated spicy scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the lands of Lumeria</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translations for multiple languages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585690/extras/baddb8f72857e34ace592abac9fbe2ad.avif?t=1743174818\" width=568 height=278 /></span></p>",
